 types' METH_COEXIST methods (dict_methods', list_methods', set_methods' and"] [276 1 "// frozenset_methods' __getitem__ and __contains__): method descriptors where the other slots have slot wrappers."] [296 5 "// object's own slots take the instance itself, not a built-in subclass's value: object.__str__ of an"] [297 5 "// int subclass is repr(self), its class's __repr__ (queue 287: test_enum's __str__ = object.__str__)"] [303 2 "// the number protocol's binary methods (__add__, __radd__, __iadd__ ...): the Binary, RBinary and InPlace"] [304 2 "// slots, NotImplemented when they do not apply (PY6h's REQUEST, queue 200: test_asyncio reads int.__add__)"] [329 6 "// wrap_ternaryfunc_r: the operands swapped, the modulus third"] [342 22 "// wrap_indexargfunc"] [353 4 "// object_str: tp_repr, never the type's own __str__ (REQUEST of PY6g for PY6-core: a class with"] [354 4 "// __str__ = object.__str__, doctest's DocTestCase, recursed without end)"] [475 5 "// dict_subscript sees self's type: a subclass's d.__getitem__(k) calls its __missing__ as d[k] does"] [476 5 "// (queue 202: urllib.parse's _Quoter(safe).__getitem__ raised KeyError: test_http_cookies,"] [477 5 "// test_wsgiref's request_uri)"] [585 3 "// one object per type, so that object.__new__ is object.__new__ (enum's _find_new_ compares them;"] [586 3 "// PY5e, part 2b)"] [590 3 "// tp_new_wrapper's builtin: object.__new__'s __self__ is object, its __qualname__ object.__new__ (queue 290:"] [591 3 "// inspect drops its $type parameter)"] [640 6 "// unicode__format__, long__format__, float___format__, complex___format__: an empty spec is the"] [641 6 "// subclass's str() (queue 287: int's gave the int's text, test_enum's overridden __str__)"] [646 19 "// object.__format__ is str(self), the instance's own __str__ (queue 287)"] [680 1 "// hackCheck is hackcheck: m's __setattr__ called on self, whose built-in base nearest to its type overrides it"] [681 1 "// (object.__setattr__(str, ...) would jump over type's own)